import{_ as i,o as n,c as t,a2 as o}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse(`{"title":"Entry 488 | Dragon Rune · Gu Chensha's Predatory-Thinking Decomposition: The Gift Essence of Bearing Sins for Myriad Ranks","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 488 | Dragon Rune · Gu Chensha's Predatory-Thinking Decomposition: The Gift Essence of Bearing Sins for Myriad Ranks","no":488,"module":2,"tags":["Myriad-Realms Benchmark","Dragon Rune","Gu Chensha","Predatory Thinking","Bearing Sins for Myriad Ranks","Gift System"],"related":["04-Anti-Predation Core Thesis","26-Individual-and-Collective Balance Principle","06-More-Work-More-Reward Distribution Principle"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0488_模块2-龙符-古尘沙掠夺思维拆解-替众生承罪的恩赐本质.md","filePath":"en/0488_模块2-龙符-古尘沙掠夺思维拆解-替众生承罪的恩赐本质.md"}`),s={name:"en/0488_模块2-龙符-古尘沙掠夺思维拆解-替众生承罪的恩赐本质.md"};function a(r,e,l,d,h,u){return n(),t("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[o('<h1 id="entry-488-dragon-rune-·-gu-chensha-s-predatory-thinking-decomposition-the-gift-essence-of-bearing-sins-for-myriad-ranks" tabindex="-1">Entry 488 | Dragon Rune · Gu Chensha&#39;s Predatory-Thinking Decomposition: The Gift Essence of Bearing Sins for Myriad Ranks <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-488-dragon-rune-·-gu-chensha-s-predatory-thinking-decomposition-the-gift-essence-of-bearing-sins-for-myriad-ranks" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 488 | Dragon Rune · Gu Chensha&#39;s Predatory-Thinking Decomposition: The Gift Essence of Bearing Sins for Myriad Ranks&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Dragon Rune Decomposition (Entry 4) | Benchmark base: Documents 04, 26, 06</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-the-greatest-good-deed-also-the-most-hidden-predation" tabindex="-1">Introduction: the greatest good deed, also the most hidden predation <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-the-greatest-good-deed-also-the-most-hidden-predation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: the greatest good deed, also the most hidden predation&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Heng Yuan Zhou (Myriad-Spirits Balanced-Anchor Origin Universe)&#39;s six top-level axioms — anti-predation axiom, republican axiom of Myriad Races, collective ascension axiom, causal self-discipline axiom, <strong>law-first axiom</strong>, universal equal infinite law as core — judges &quot;predatory thinking&quot; not by motive good/evil, but by structural consequences. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. Gu Chensha &quot;vows to bear all sins and karmic retribution on behalf of Myriad Ranks&quot;; motive purely good; but structural consequence is &quot;undertaking&quot; Myriad Ranks&#39; subjectivity as well.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones&quot;">​</a></h2><p>&quot;Bearing sins for Myriad Ranks&quot;&#39;s energy waste manifests in: it skips the causal process that Myriad Ranks themselves should learn, bear, grow. Myriad Ranks therefore never learn &quot;why they were wrong, how to correct&quot; — <strong>energy used to carry for others equals carrying away people&#39;s growth right as well.</strong></p><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression&quot;">​</a></h2><p>When someone bears sins for you, Myriad Ranks lose the motivation to correct. After a thousand years, Myriad Ranks&#39; moral level, responsibility consciousness, causal judgment not rise but fall — because &quot;anyway someone carries it.&quot; This is the gift system&#39;s deepest poison: <strong>it keeps the gifted permanently in a child&#39;s state.</strong></p><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking&quot;">​</a></h2><p>This entry&#39;s core. Gu Chensha&#39;s predation has three layers:</p><ol><li><strong>Responsibility predation</strong>: bearing onto himself the responsibility Myriad Ranks should bear.</li><li><strong>Growth predation</strong>: carrying away what Myriad Ranks should learn from bearing.</li><li><strong>Subjectivity predation</strong>: negating Myriad Ranks&#39; qualification to &quot;make their own choices, bear their own consequences.&quot;</li></ol><p>Three stacked, &quot;all beings between heaven and earth can become dragons&quot; becomes empty talk — because becoming a dragon&#39;s premise is &quot;walk by oneself,&quot; but Gu Chensha already paved the road, carried across the ditches, stepped on the thunder for you. Myriad Ranks are not becoming dragons; Myriad Ranks are <strong>being made into dragons.</strong></p><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Gu Chensha Bears Sins for Myriad Ranks</th><th>Anchor-Symbiosis Alternative</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>He carries everything</td><td>Myriad Ranks bear their own karma</td></tr><tr><td>Myriad Ranks do not grow</td><td>Causal self-discipline: observe first then interfere; let Myriad Ranks learn</td></tr><tr><td>Gift-style dragon-becoming</td><td>Myriad-Ranks republicanism: walk yourself, become yourself</td></tr><tr><td>Moral high ground monopolized</td><td>Morality is public issue, not one person carrying</td></tr><tr><td>He great, Myriad Ranks small</td><td>99% Myriad-Ranks coverage; everyone has a road</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Quest Sediment Domain control: Path A = Gu Chensha bears sins for Myriad Ranks; Path B = Myriad Ranks bear themselves. Path A after a thousand years, Myriad Ranks&#39; moral level stagnant, responsibility consciousness weak; Path B after a thousand years, Myriad Ranks&#39; moral level autonomously rises, responsibility consciousness internalized. <strong>Bearing sins for others raises a group of children who never grow up.</strong></p><p>This control also reveals a deeper ethical problem: Gu Chensha &quot;bears sins for Myriad Ranks,&quot; sounds selfless, but it structurally completes a &quot;de-sinification&quot; of Myriad Ranks — Myriad Ranks need not be responsible for their own actions, because someone is responsible for them. This sounds compassionate, actually cancels Myriad Ranks&#39; opportunity to learn &quot;be responsible for yourself.&quot; A child whose parents backstop everything since childhood grows up not truly independent; a civilization backstopped by Gu Chensha for all sins, after ten thousand years, not truly autonomous either. <strong>If compassion comes at the price of canceling subjectivity, it is not compassion, it is spoiling.</strong></p><p>Gu Chensha&#39;s &quot;bearing sins for Myriad Ranks&quot; is narratively extremely contagious — one person carrying the whole cosmos&#39;s sins is one of web fiction history&#39;s most tragic images. But Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s structural analysis is unmoved by contagion: a tragic image, if at the price of canceling Myriad Ranks&#39; subjectivity, it is tragic predation. <strong>One person bearing sins for everyone sounds like a god; but if everyone therefore never learns to bear sins themselves, he is not a god, he is a nursemaid — and a bad nursemaid who lets all children never grow up.</strong> What Heng Yuan Zhou wants is not &quot;a god who bears sins for Myriad Ranks,&quot; but &quot;a system that lets Myriad Ranks learn to bear sins themselves.&quot;</p><p>Gu Chensha&#39;s &quot;bearing sins for Myriad Ranks&quot; is narratively the highest-level predation — because it wears the most sacred robe. Other predators at least have the possibility of being opposed (Tang San&#39;s hunting can be opposed, Ye Fan&#39;s position can be questioned); Gu Chensha&#39;s sin-bearing almost cannot be opposed — who opposes &quot;the one who bears sins for you&quot;? This &quot;unopposable predation&quot; is the most stable of all predation forms. Heng Yuan Zhou to break it can only rely on one logic: <strong>true compassion is letting Myriad Ranks learn to bear sins themselves, not bearing sins for them forever.</strong></p><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Setting self-consistency: medium-low</strong>. &quot;Number one in history carries for Myriad Ranks&quot; itself unsustainable under civilizational logic</li><li><strong>Retcon-ending risk: high</strong></li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency: extremely high</strong></li></ul><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: growth right carried away as well</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: greatest good deed = most hidden subjectivity predation</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo at least let students practice themselves; Gu Chensha does not even let students make mistakes</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: Myriad Ranks gifted, not empowered</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: subjectivity not returned; cosmos is single log</li><li><strong>Universal equal infinite law</strong>: basic infinite power inherent in all; easygoing retain guarantee, strivers can superimpose higher; infinite origin eliminates predation motive</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s judgment on Gu Chensha is not that he is not good, but that he is <strong>too good.</strong> So good that Myriad Ranks do not need to be good; so good that the cosmos does not need to run itself. True symbiosis is not &quot;I carry it for you,&quot; but &quot;you have ability to carry it yourself, I carry it with you.&quot;</p><p>In the final analysis, Dragon Rune · Gu Chensha&#39;s predatory-thinking decomposition · the gift essence of bearing sins for Myriad Ranks described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./485_模块2-龙符-总论古尘沙与独木式文明定性.html">Entry 485 · Overview</a> · <a href="./489_模块2-龙符-天地众生皆可成龙批判-被成龙的恩赐制.html">Entry 489 · &quot;All Beings Can Become Dragons&quot;</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/26-个体与集体平衡原理.html">26-Individual-and-Collective Balance Principle</a></li></ul>',29)])])}const y=i(s,[["render",a]]);export{g as __pageData,y as default};
